h\" data-math=\"y=-x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.24-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Each of the following curves are of the form</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"xy=a\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a constant. In each case state the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/124-q2a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/124-q2b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nxy=k\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2\\times8=16\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore xy=16\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\na=16\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nxy=k\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2\\times-4.9=-9\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore xy=-9\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\na=-9\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.24-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Show that the two asymptotes of the curve</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2-y^2=k\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>are perpendicular to each other.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2-y^2=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has asymptotes <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"