n>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\pm3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Asymptotes: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.24/solutions/assets/diagrams/124-p3-2.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}2-\\frac{y^2}2=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\pm\\sqrt2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Asymptotes: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.24/solutions/assets/diagrams/124-p4-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y^2-x^2=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\pm\\sqrt3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Asymptotes: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.24/solutions/assets/diagrams/124-p4-2.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.24-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>For curves below find the value of the constant <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, given each may be written in the form</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2-y^2=k\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/124-q5a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/124-q5b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.24/questions/assets/diagrams/124-q5c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}4-\\frac{y^2}4=1\\quad\\therefore k=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}8-\\frac{y^2}8=1\\quad\\therefore k=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}5-\\frac{y^2}5=-1\\Rightarrow x^2-y^2=-5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore k=-5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.24-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>For constant <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, a curve given by the equation</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2-y^2=k\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>The curve passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(a,-\\sqrt b)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for positive constants, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Find the values at which it passes through the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=a^2-b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\sqrt{a^2-b}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\sqrt{a^2-b}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]}]